{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Brussels this evening, exhausted but in good spirits. I am staying at the house of my friend Van Ghert, whose hospitality is most welcome. Madame Van Ghert was kind enough to cut a fresh quill for me, a small gesture that made the room feel less like an inn and more like home.\n\nI have received your letter from the post office, which I have read with great pleasure. It is a comfort to hear of the household’s peace while I am away. The journey has been steady, though the fatigue accumulates. I find myself thinking of our sons and the quiet order of our Berlin home more than usual.\n\nI shall not stay long. The road calls, and I must continue my observations of this part of the world. I hope this letter finds you well and that the boys are behaving as they should.\n\nYour loving Georg"}}],"created":1795080600,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":183,"prompt_tokens":915,"total_tokens":1098,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-l6aNrUrXhqNhkJ3CDGWiASoUHC3WEvvu","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":915,"prompt_ms":911.328,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9959868852459016,"prompt_per_second":1004.0292847361213,"predicted_n":183,"predicted_ms":4424.979,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.31307142857143,"predicted_per_second":41.13013869670342}}